    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213790/extras/e166911faef0473745ad6e927fc6b0b9.avif?t=1755205142\" data-has-big width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Red Pistol</i> is a roguelike bullet-hell set in a dark and twisted Wild West, where survival demands precision, strategy, and skill. As bounty hunter Reed Ransom, you must battle relentless hordes of undead, hunt notorious outlaws, and confront the vampire Varius Valentine\u2014the mastermind behind the undead plague consuming the frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With procedurally generated maps, evolving combat strategies, and an ever-growing bounty on your head, no two runs are the same. Unlock powerful upgrades, experiment with unique builds through the <strong>skill card system</strong>, and engage in fast-paced shootouts where every shot matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213790/extras/cde83774befcd906f5f493e5a4eee10f.poster.avif?t=1755205142\" width=644 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213790/extras/cde83774befcd906f5f493e5a4eee10f.webm?t=1755205142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213790/extras/cde83774befcd906f5f493e5a4eee10f.mp4?t=1755205142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>wanted system</strong> increases the challenge dynamically\u2014raising your notoriety means stronger enemies will come for you. Meanwhile, the <strong>camp evolves</strong> as you progress, reflecting your journey and offering new upgrades to push deeper into the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the chaos of battle, <i>Red Pistol</i> delivers a rich narrative rarely seen in the genre. Meet intriguing characters, uncover secrets of the <strong>Dark West</strong>, and make crucial choices that shape Reed\u2019s fate. Will his newfound power be his salvation\u2026 or his downfall?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213790/extras/c88477c23f9591b22f5ad42227f68aea.poster.avif?t=1755205142\" width=606 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213790/extras/c88477c23f9591b22f5ad42227f68aea.webm?t=1755205142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213790/extras/c88477c23f9591b22f5ad42227f68aea.mp4?t=1755205142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Bullet-Hell Combat</strong> \u2013 Dodge, shoot, and adapt in intense, skill-based battles against relentless foes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression</strong> \u2013 Experiment with different builds using the skill card system, evolving weapons, and permanent upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213790/extras/acd3b884cd47098b815d8bbc09dc3fd8.poster.avif?t=1755205142\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213790/extras/acd3b884cd47098b815d8bbc09dc3fd8.webm?t=1755205142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213790/extras/acd3b884cd47098b815d8bbc09dc3fd8.mp4?t=1755205142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wanted Poster System</strong> \u2013 The higher your bounty, the more dangerous the enemies that come after you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Treacherous Worlds</strong> \u2013 Explore RedWood, Desolation Sands, Whispering Pines, and Crimson Mansion\u2014each with distinct enemies and challenges.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Battles</strong> \u2013 Face deadly foes like Iron Heart, Soul King, and Blazing Crown, each with their own unique attack patterns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213790/extras/ac222077530c929eb47580e1b8fbc793.poster.avif?t=1755205142\" width=614 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213790/extras/ac222077530c929eb47580e1b8fbc793.webm?t=1755205142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213790/extras/ac222077530c929eb47580e1b8fbc793.mp4?t=1755205142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Evolving Camp</strong> \u2013 Upgrade your base of operations with new tools, skills, and weapons as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Experience a rich, atmospheric narrative that unfolds with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take up your pistols, embrace the chaos, and survive the Dark West. The hunt begins soon.</strong></p>",
